OL,3,AYou Can See Everything documentary
OL,4,Astuns with huge box office debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS publication Deadline has described
OL,7,Fit as "easily the second best opening
OL,8,Fever for a documentary at the box
OL,9,Foffice after 2004s Fahrenheit 9/11",
OL,10,FMichael Moore's movie about the US's
OL,11,F2003 invasion of Iraq.
